{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.166, "n_samples": 99988, "proc_s": 1.4277, "rtf": 0.3427, "samples_sha256": "35b19893c4a395c59cf297ebbe9a0183fd7987f5932ddd5b24211260fd743719"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.79, "n_samples": 114952, "proc_s": 1.8731, "rtf": 0.3911, "samples_sha256": "43a38962e703308e317e09b87dabd3173a95646612927ad0c204ec8834e97f69"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.378, "n_samples": 81062, "proc_s": 0.9814, "rtf": 0.2906, "samples_sha256": "cea3b357a2469e3991daf23f99e1439211bb1c28707f56406e94f5154425defe"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.465, "n_samples": 83166, "proc_s": 1.1295, "rtf": 0.3259, "samples_sha256": "2fed6beea0d731b4b59aa899d858418b5860d8cbd684c6e2fe3604394dbb2c4c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.887, "n_samples": 69288, "proc_s": 0.906, "rtf": 0.3138, "samples_sha256": "56ebe8a0772b5286332181f00cf18fb7590afd8b1cd585bffd422122b47a9064"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.315, "n_samples": 79562, "proc_s": 1.4091, "rtf": 0.4251, "samples_sha256": "1040ac23f37b6054be57cc9be119680abc920e26bbbe2779cd5a4dc4bb7aff28"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.695, "n_samples": 112669, "proc_s": 1.5418, "rtf": 0.3284, "samples_sha256": "c66237f33803aa292f51be9f5d4ad7bda23ec903ec214a9e59dba018a30e5e4e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.694, "n_samples": 88665, "proc_s": 1.1059, "rtf": 0.2993, "samples_sha256": "cc5b5fdee745675cbc42fbf3b36f0c4660eb826cd40776bea407ca9a9151adb4"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.707, "n_samples": 88968, "proc_s": 1.3528, "rtf": 0.3649, "samples_sha256": "33ea98b877033234e5bc63723ab5f63b129eb456f92171e1d14cfdcbdc9ab87e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.945, "n_samples": 94684, "proc_s": 1.2686, "rtf": 0.3215, "samples_sha256": "dc5baa3b95ebb3e1f14a14212571d84cc0a1d4e21ba69aefacd819bdcf0cc210"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.693, "n_samples": 64632, "proc_s": 0.8823, "rtf": 0.3276, "samples_sha256": "86e9b8d613928abe47773b83bd175c73fdf80dc0201608f5286658cf90a01d8a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.769, "n_samples": 90459, "proc_s": 1.0244, "rtf": 0.2718, "samples_sha256": "4eee60879ea641c9130d73633c862984aeb1c91b59b85241dc4026640b10fd61"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.21, "n_samples": 101036, "proc_s": 1.3639, "rtf": 0.324, "samples_sha256": "f4274a1b173318bccb75831ad1ab581185c040a01e3a45cb4cbab90fae52d4b6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.129, "n_samples": 123094, "proc_s": 1.6562, "rtf": 0.3229, "samples_sha256": "bc714b12d545d058be559e9c61e4e9c9e3989132e64edd20d096cc57fd6299b0"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.771, "n_samples": 90492, "proc_s": 1.3145, "rtf": 0.3486, "samples_sha256": "2131fc4657776aaca0a91738bed5a46c777fc10dfa16b9a0abab13ccb4d35a63"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.239, "n_samples": 77727, "proc_s": 0.9756, "rtf": 0.3013, "samples_sha256": "45386b3aae852de3161308f3eec3aea5ae592a428f7fe27432255ec4d75b51b9"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.935, "n_samples": 94443, "proc_s": 1.3326, "rtf": 0.3386, "samples_sha256": "e3338bdd7d36a95d65423a8ecd278bb47f243b581e5abd4bb63fce4ae2687bf2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.483, "n_samples": 83602, "proc_s": 0.9844, "rtf": 0.2826, "samples_sha256": "309819f879bbbea21159797d4c3638fa7d56d8bbc547c6c625441eb9750f40b9"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.244, "n_samples": 53865, "proc_s": 0.7485, "rtf": 0.3335, "samples_sha256": "e533e203e6586a9b72b5b08735dd83420f9c01077107281beda0629f2b745004"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.897, "n_samples": 93529, "proc_s": 1.3805, "rtf": 0.3542, "samples_sha256": "4fc12daab500fe09f1238c9f1f961cc0caa7d8e29359a68dc35ace7190d92c9e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.577, "n_samples": 85856, "proc_s": 1.1975, "rtf": 0.3347, "samples_sha256": "659eb00d0d6773df39110ae4fbc28031441b5cb1383fd045318c0410930a0b6e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.514, "n_samples": 108346, "proc_s": 1.4656, "rtf": 0.3246, "samples_sha256": "f42edcff360d85ef2414284eb5223e19c67aaf6cc999baa6c13786be6fedb771"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.832, "n_samples": 91959, "proc_s": 1.0847, "rtf": 0.2831, "samples_sha256": "e4980d9a51687c9339fded6f4b4fe4616ecb41a08ec9324ffa3af09a2b74a349"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.242, "n_samples": 101796, "proc_s": 1.5797, "rtf": 0.3724, "samples_sha256": "9711f2298b8066fca1ecb2189dc8b03a28245b09f2bdea2743b21663645baaeb"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.83, "n_samples": 91921, "proc_s": 1.2186, "rtf": 0.3182, "samples_sha256": "897a0714c57f9055fd7ef96e4a22ba8244e7f0cb0faf69d0c6db66bef2452543"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.261, "n_samples": 78276, "proc_s": 0.9043, "rtf": 0.2773, "samples_sha256": "4cb88befe2669f4df5d5a6c3b2f8e448832550e9c6aeb1a350bf8b76168faa37"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid45", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.273, "n_samples": 102543, "proc_s": 1.1339, "rtf": 0.2654, "samples_sha256": "44d95c41ba5c7b8d833e84616280da5dced2fa1e266a13bd6771a20a3e4bec43"}
